{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04229","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋萤 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋萤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉虬分静夜，金萤照晚凉。\n含辉疑泛月，带火怯凌霜。\n散彩萦虚牖，飘花绕洞房。\n下帷如不倦，当解惜余光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}